## After any fix / build / write / create (this repo)

Before marking implementation done:

1. Run **ponytail-review** on your session diff (`.cursor/skills/ponytail-review/SKILL.md`).
2. Append the **Ponytail review** block to your final reply.
3. Apply obvious safe cuts in the same session unless user said report-only.

Skip: Q&A with no code edits, report-only, empty diff.
